## Risk Assessment

| Risk Factor                         | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation Plan                                                                 |
|-------------------------------------|------------|--------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Technical delays in model integration | High       | High   | Allocate additional engineering resources and introduce external consultants.   |
| Employee burnout                     | Medium     | High   | Implement flexible work schedules and mental health support programs.          |
| Investor dissatisfaction             | Medium     | High   | Provide regular financial updates and transparent milestone tracking.          |
| Market competition                   | Medium     | Medium | Accelerate product launches and prioritize unique feature development.         |

